            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nothing? (nihil.) Nobody? (nēmō, nēminis.) No? (nūllus, nūlla, nūllum.) Which? (uter, utra, utrum.) And not? (neque.) Recently? (nūper.) The day before yesterday? (nudiustertius.) Once? (ōlim.) Before? (anteā.) To happen? (accidō, accidere.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
