            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The day after tomorrow? (perendiē.) Afterwards? (posteā.) A plan; advice? (cōnsilium, cōnsiliī.) To decide? (cōnstituō, cōnstituere.) To foresee? (prōvideō, prōvidēre.) A notice? (titulus, titulī.) An inscription? (īnscrīptiō, īnscrīptiōnis.) A price? (pretium, pretiī.) For sale? (vēnālis, vēnāle.) Goods? (merx, mercis.)"
